 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 509936,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Explain the error in the following calculation and correct the problem:<br>\n<span data-math=\"{133_4} + {112_4} = {245_4}\">{133_4} + {112_4} = {245_4}</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The symbols 4 and 5 are not used in base 4.</p>\n<p>Step 1: Do the one’s place first.</p>\n<p>In base 10: 3 + 2 = 5</p>\n<p>In base 4: 11</p>\n<p>One’s place: 1</p>\n<p>Carry: 1</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Carry:</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>=</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Next step: Do the next place to the left.</p>\n<p>In base 10: 1 + 3 + 1 = 5</p>\n<p>In base 4: 11</p>\n<p>This column: 1</p>\n<p>Carry: 1</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Carry:</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>=</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span data-math=\"{311_4}\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "The symbols 4 and 5 are not legal symbols in base 4. Careful use of the base 4 addition table would correct this error.<br>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><b>3</b></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\nThe correct answer is 311<sub>4</sub>."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
